Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Regular File Topology Projection

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect transform that consumes one output-only supplied-content stable binding, validates a strict caller placement plan, and releases one lineage-preserving wrapper around a complete structurally valid M2A regular-file topology projection without claiming physical, Git, traversal, stream-completeness, receipt, or admission provenance.

